
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="my">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>MMK Rewards</title>
<style>
body {
  margin: 0;
  padding: 20px;
  font-family: sans-serif;
  background: #f0f4f9;
  color: #172b43;
}
.card {
  background: white;
  padding: 20px;
  margin-bottom: 14px;
  border-radius: 16px;
  text-align: center;
}
h1 { color: #1685e5; }
button {
  width: 100%;
  padding: 14px;
  margin-top: 10px;
  border: 0;
  border-radius: 10px;
  background: #1685e5;
  color: white;
  font-size: 16px;
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="card">
  <h1>MMK Rewards 🎁</h1>
  <p>ကြိုဆိုပါတယ်!</p>
  <h2 id="points">0 Points</h2>
  <small>Demo Points သာဖြစ်ပြီး ငွေသားမဟုတ်ပါ။</small>
</div>
<div class="card">
  <h3>🎯 Daily Bonus</h3>
  <button onclick="bonus()">Bonus စမ်းယူမယ်</button>
  <p id="message"></p>
</div>
<div class="card">
  <h3>🎮 Free Games</h3>
  <p>Quiz ဂိမ်း မကြာမီလာမည်။</p>
</div>
<div class="card">
  <h3>💰 Wallet</h3>
  <p>ငွေထုတ်စနစ် မတပ်ဆင်ရသေးပါ။</p>
</div>
<script>
let points = 0;

function bonus() {
  points += 10;
  document.getElementById("points").textContent =
    points + " Points";
  document.getElementById("message").textContent =
    "Demo Bonus +10 Points ရပါပြီ!";
}
</script>
</body>
</html>
